      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze this property inspection photo and categorize it precisely.\n     \n     Identify:\n     1. The main component category (e.g., Roofing, Pool/Spa, HVAC, Plumbing, Electrical, Flooring, Exterior, Elevator/Lift, Parking, Common Areas, Landscaping, Structural, Windows/Doors, Fire Safety, or Other)\n     2. A specific subcategory that describes the exact type or feature\n     3. Any notable observations about condition or characteristics\n     \n     Be specific and accurate in your categorization.",
